<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47833" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ter-dĕcĭes</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-ĭens</span></b> , adv.
		num., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>thirteen times</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quem circulum luna terdecies in duodecim
					mensibus percurrit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr. 9,
					4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">respirare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv.
					14, 28</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">HS. terdeciens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 3, 80, § 184</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">binas terdecies, semel quaternas,</span>”
				i. e. <i>thirty</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Aus. Ep. 7, 32</span></i>
			.</div>
